  "title": "The Very Best Spaghetti Sauce",
  "description": "Fresh roma tomatoes are gently simmered with zucchini, green and red bell pepper, mushrooms and herbs. The addition of ricotta cheese, just before serving, makes the sauce nice and rich.",
  "authors": [
    "Jenny R"
  ],
